MediaTek MT7927 firmware notice

This package extracts and installs the following binary firmware from an
official ASUS driver archive:

- BT_RAM_CODE_MT6639_2_1_hdr.bin

The same build input also contains Wi-Fi firmware. This package deliberately
does not install those files because linux-firmware-mediatek provides newer
MediaTek-submitted versions.

The installed firmware is not included in this source repository and is not
covered by GPL-2.0-only. Copyright and other rights remain with MediaTek Inc.,
